{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Sh: Call a script, case, case example, Command-line arguments, Function, and If else, and related topics.","label":"Sh","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/scp","label":"scp","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/scp"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ssh","label":"SSH","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Sh: Call a script, case, case example, Command-line arguments, Function, and If else, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Call a script<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun a shell script with sh and optional positional arguments.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>case<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShell case syntax matching values and running the matching statement.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>case example<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA case branch on TEST, including a default * pattern.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Command-line arguments<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPositional parameters in a shell script, indexed from 1.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Function<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDefine a shell function, refer to $1 arguments, and call it. POSIX function keyword on dash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>If else<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShell if, elif, and else syntax, with numerical and string comparison operators.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Include<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSource another shell file with . (alias for source).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Inline<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInline a command's output in a string with $(...).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Output to file and screen<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSend stdout and stderr to both the screen and a file with tee -a.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Shebang<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPortable bash shebang using env, and why sh is not bash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>String<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSingle quotes block variable expansion unless they sit inside double quotes.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/call' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/call' data-title='Call'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/call\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Call<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case' data-title='case'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>case<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case_2' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case_2' data-title='case example'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/case_2\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>case example<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/command_line_arguments' data-target='computer\/os\/nix